# x on an Overdue entry removes it although completed blocks are shown, and z brings it back focused.
file <<END
- First @due({today-2})
- Second @due({today-2})
- Third @due({today-1})
END
keys gO j x
hide Second
see ▌ - Third
keys z
see ▌ - Second
quit
saved <<END
- First @due({today-2})
- Second @due({today-2})
- Third @due({today-1})
END
